changelog: startTbl;
  1:"ADDITION|Added the Flame glove.";
  1:"ADDITION|Added rifts that can spawn around the map.";
  2:"ADDITION|Added some UI enhancements.";
  3:"ADDITION|Added the Temporal bossfight.";
  4:"ADDITION|Added a passive ability (plague) to Infector.";
  5:"ADDITION|Added 4 new settings options: Self Music Volume, Self Music Rolloff Distance, Other Music Volume, and Other Music Rolloff Distance.";
  6:"ADDITION|Added the Metal Dummies.";
  7:"CHANGE|Changed the price of Temporal from 750 to 500.";
  7:"CHANGE|Your health now increases as you get more kills to account for the passive abilities of Infector and Flame. (+10/9 HP every kill after 10 kills)";
  7:"CHANGE|Merged Revelation Engine and Massive Engine as all systems from ME have been moved over to RE.";
  7:"CHANGE|The size of the UI sidebar buttons now decrease if too many buttons are enabled. (this really only affects devs)";
  7:"CHANGE|The volume of Streak Music is no longer determined by the gloves Phases. You can configure the volume in the settings.";
  8:"FIXES|Fixed an issue where the sound section in settings said Visual Effects.";
  9:"FIXES|Fixed an issue where closing the variant GUI would result in a broken glove.";
  9:"FIXES|Fixed the mobile UI being completely broken on tablet, making the game nearly unplayable.";
  10:"REMOVAL|Removed Herobrine.";
endTbl;

